flowchart TD
    S[Start command group] --> R{Observe owned work}
    R -->|command and output finish| N[Return command result]
    R -->|server deadline| T[Stop command group]
    R -->|client cancellation| C[Cancel command group]
    R -->|output budget| L[Return output-limit error]
    T --> E[Return timeout error]
    E --> M[timedOut true]
    C --> O[No timeout marker]
